      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果是流水结构的话应该可以建立一套反馈系统，\n急还没有全部设计完就留到中间的时候我就可以直接去验证了，\n然后看一下前面的符不符合逻辑然后再看后面能不能加",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zq5ukbzMea5t52s821T3b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3502.5963992956463,
      "y": -2028.1493125758855,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 376603285,
      "version": 53,
      "versionNonce": 953981884,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767422165019,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这是最完美的，任何一个设计理念最好都能边搭建边设计边验证",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这是最完美的，任何一个设计理念最好都能边搭建边设计边验证",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
